 "notes": "Unit's own 'caves nearby' has no direction. S2760 lists only 'Cisterns', so the row was treated as the feature itself and dated from its periods (D); as a plain component it would be U. 'IA2c tomb' and the Per tombs are not described as rock-cut or shaft tombs, so cavity_with_opening false; 'Sheikh's tomb in cave' taken as a burial cave (true). E384 'Qubur Bani Israil' lists only megalithic buildings, not graves; not coded. The ritual bath (S2803/E411) coded as pool, unclear. Crypt (S2990) taken as a burial chamber. Rock shelters not coded. No SWP entry in packet."
